<p>Theresa W. Carey</p>
<p><a href="https://technet.microsoft.com/en-us/AssetId:a7997a29-2bf3-4470-8416-c4e7ef1d94ef" title="Web Q&amp;A" data-linktype="external">Web Q&amp;A:</a>&nbsp;<a href="https://technet.microsoft.com/en-us/AssetId:a7997a29-2bf3-4470-8416-c4e7ef1d94ef" title="Switch Focus Between Frames, Connect a Web Page to a Database" data-linktype="external">Switch Focus Between Frames, Connect a Web Page to a Database</a></p>
